## ObjectType: classifier

Source label: classifier. Source IRI: `https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/Classifier`. Source definition: denoter that classifies some entity

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|------|--------------|------|-------------|--------------|
| entity_id | Entity ID | string | Stable identifier for an entity record in this BKN projection. | entity_id |
| source_iri | Source IRI | string | IOF class IRI. | source_iri |
| source_label | Source Label | string | Original IOF label. | source_label |
| source_definition | Source Definition | text | Original IOF natural-language definition. | source_definition |
| is_synthetic_reference_instance | Is Synthetic Reference Instance | boolean | Marks a record used only for IOF class coverage and relation demonstration. | is_synthetic_reference_instance |
| reference_instance_note | Reference Instance Note | text | Does not assert this reference record as an operational fact. | reference_instance_note |
| categorized_by_target_id | categorized by Target ID | string | Target entity ID linked through IOF property `https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/categorizedBy`. | categorized_by_target_id |
| categorizes_target_id | categorizes Target ID | string | Target entity ID linked through IOF property `https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/categorizes`. | categorizes_target_id |
| generalizes_target_id | generalizes Target ID | string | Target entity ID linked through IOF property `https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/generalizes`. | generalizes_target_id |
| specializes_target_id | specializes Target ID | string | Target entity ID linked through IOF property `https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/specializes`. | specializes_target_id |

